<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Illinois Health Facilities Auth.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Illinois Health Facilities Auth.</headline>
<text>
<p>ILLINOIS HEALTH FACILITIES AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $183,815,000</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>(LOYOLA UNIVERSITY HEALTH SYSTEM)</p>
<p>Effective at 4:00 P.M. E.D.T., Wednesday, June 18, 1997 all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter</p>
